            "review_title": "Review at Ruby Soho Saigon",
            "review_text": "Sherpa760942\nUnited States3 contributions\n0\nToo HOT - too LOUD..!\nJul 2022\nBefore the pandemic this was the best bar in District 7. Great music, excellent service and nice cool air flow with fans and aircon. Have returned to D7 after two years and this bar is now too HOT, stuffy, no air flow and uncomfortable. Yes the service is still friendly & attentive, but why is the music at such high volume that guests cannot hear each other speak. Music is for background atmosphere - its not a nightclub. Normally I would talk with a manager before writing a review. However, it seems Ruby Soho does not have a manager. They need to fix the air-con and have fans to add to the air-flow. Turn down the volume to keep as background music. People want to sit in cool comfort and enjoy each others conversations.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 23, 2022",
