            "review_title": "Review at Ruby Soho Saigon",
            "review_text": "Matt L\n9 contributions\n0\nA great and friendly bar with a cool theme\nAug 2019\nRuby Soho is a really cool little bar with a great artistic vibe. The owner, Fred, is a cool guy and we had a great conversation about art. Turns out he's a cartoonist! It's a fun little hangout in District 7, so if you find yourself in the area, check it out.\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 18, 2019",
