            "review_title": "Review at Ruby Soho Saigon",
            "review_text": "G.\nAustralia267 contributions\n1\nDistrict 7 Heaven\nSep 2018\nCome to District 7 and visit Fred and his team at this amazing bar. Hundreds of cool photos adorn the walls, AMAZING margaritas, cold beer and everything else you can imagine. Large screen for viewing sports or music videos (Fred KNOWS his music)....food is pretty good too. This is our \"go-to\" bar in Saigon. Extremely reasonable prices and great location - right beside Saigon Cycle.\n\nHIGHLY RECOMMEND\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 11, 2019",
